{
    "title": "Yassir - Ride, Eat & Shop",
    "description": "Welcome to Yassir, the all-in-one super app that simplifies your life. With Yassir, you can access on-demand daily services such as ride-hailing, food and grocery delivery, and payments. Say goodbye to life's hassles and enjoy a smoother, more enjoyable daily routine. \r\n\r\nOur services include : \r\n\r\nYassir Go is your ultimate ride-hailing service that eliminates all transportation-related hassles. We offer a range of transportation options to cater to your needs and budget, whether you need a quick ride to the office or a night out on the town. Our transportation options include:\r\n\r\n- Classic: Affordable city rides.\r\n- Comfort: Enjoy comfortable rides in newer cars.\r\n- Space: Rides with friends or family in large vehicles.\r\n- Chrono: Reserve a driver for as long as you need.\r\n- Yassir Women: Book a woman driver.\r\n- Premium: Book a premium ride in a high-end car.\r\n\r\nOur extensive network of drivers is just a tap away, ensuring you reach your destination swiftly and comfortably.\r\n\r\nYassir Express - Food at Your Fingertips\r\nSatisfy your cravings with our go-to food delivery and ordering service. We have a vast selection of restaurants that bring many delicious options to your doorstep. You can easily browse menus, place orders, and enjoy speedy deliveries \u2013 all within the app.\r\n\r\nYassir Market - Your Grocery Shopping Companion\r\nExperience the convenience of grocery shopping without leaving your home or office with Yassir Market - your on-demand grocery service. No more tiring visits to the supermarket or struggling with heavy bags. Simply order your groceries, and our team will deliver your products to your doorstep. We offer various grocery items, including fresh produce, pantry staples, and household essentials.\r\n\r\nYassir Pay - Secure and Convenient Payments\r\nSimplify your daily transactions, use Yassir Pay to pay for your rides, meals, and grocery deliveries directly within our all-in-one app. You can top up your account using local payment cards and enjoy exclusive discounts and offers on Yassir's on-demand services.\r\n\r\nWhy Yassir?\r\n- Multiple services in one app for your convenience.\r\n- 24h/7 Availability.\r\n- Drivers and delivery agents trained to guarantee you the best service and safety on the road.\r\n- Payment in cash, banking cards, and through the wallet feature.\r\n- Offers and promo codes section to help you save while getting the most out of our services. \r\n- Customer support via In-app chat, email, and phone. \r\n\r\nWith more than 150,000 partners in 58 cities worldwide. We\u2019re about creating a marketplace to bring people what they need while infusing social values.\r\n\r\nVisit www.yassir.com for the complete list of countries and cities we operate in.\r\n\r\nFollow us on social media:\r\n- Facebook https://www.facebook.com/Yassir\r\n- X (Twitter) : https://twitter.com/Yassir_Globall\r\n- LinkedIn : https://www.linkedin.com/company/yassir/\r\n\r\nYou need help? support@yassir.com\r\nYassir, life just got easier! Rides | Food | Groceries | Payments",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Yassir, the all-in-one super app that simplifies your life. With Yassir, you can access on-demand daily services such as ride-hailing, food and grocery delivery, and payments. Say goodbye to life&#39;s hassles and enjoy a smoother, more enjoyable daily routine. <br><br>Our services include : <br><br>Yassir Go is your ultimate ride-hailing service that eliminates all transportation-related hassles. We offer a range of transportation options to cater to your needs and budget, whether you need a quick ride to the office or a night out on the town. Our transportation options include:<br><br>- Classic: Affordable city rides.<br>- Comfort: Enjoy comfortable rides in newer cars.<br>- Space: Rides with friends or family in large vehicles.<br>- Chrono: Reserve a driver for as long as you need.<br>- Yassir Women: Book a woman driver.<br>- Premium: Book a premium ride in a high-end car.<br><br>Our extensive network of drivers is just a tap away, ensuring you reach your destination swiftly and comfortably.<br><br>Yassir Express - Food at Your Fingertips<br>Satisfy your cravings with our go-to food delivery and ordering service. We have a vast selection of restaurants that bring many delicious options to your doorstep. You can easily browse menus, place orders, and enjoy speedy deliveries \u2013 all within the app.<br><br>Yassir Market - Your Grocery Shopping Companion<br>Experience the convenience of grocery shopping without leaving your home or office with Yassir Market - your on-demand grocery service. No more tiring visits to the supermarket or struggling with heavy bags. Simply order your groceries, and our team will deliver your products to your doorstep. We offer various grocery items, including fresh produce, pantry staples, and household essentials.<br><br>Yassir Pay - Secure and Convenient Payments<br>Simplify your daily transactions, use Yassir Pay to pay for your rides, meals, and grocery deliveries directly within our all-in-one ap